    "reaction": "I am stopping here. I liked Yusuf saying we did not ask for grain, but we accept it, and the Kuyucu man asking who will feed my family while I cut his barley - that is exactly the knot between the landowner and the valley I came for. But every visit is one greeting with nothing to say back, and fifteen real minutes bought one game day while I declined to insist. I understood it; there was too little for me to do in the waiting. Note: pressing I am stopping put those words into the note box by itself; I typed nothing and did not submit. I would not leave it running. I might return another evening on desktop if visits let me actually talk with Yusuf or Danyal, and if refusing to insist did not leave the clock crawling.",
